<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>把事实塞进上下文 —— 前提是塞进去它就用得到</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", gap: 20}}><Box style={{height: 250, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 2, height: 74, borderRadius: 6, overflow: "hidden"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)"}}></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.14)"}}></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)"}}></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", marginTop: 14}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>开头：记得住</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#A32D2D"}}>中段：开始看漏</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>结尾：还看得见</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 262, flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#A32D2D"}}>上下文超过一定长度后</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>模型对中段的召回会下降</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>最小脚手架也能跑出结果</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>一个 prompt、一个 Bash、一个 Edit</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>所以最好的上下文工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>往往是「少放」，不是「多放」</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>06 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
